    "Closing the window keeps Launchpad in the menu bar, where you can start and stop machines. The Dock icon appears only while a window or the menu is open.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Closing the window keeps Launchpad in the menu bar, where you can start and stop machines. The Dock icon appears only while a window or the menu is open."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "关闭窗口后，Launchpad 会保留在菜单栏中，你可以从菜单栏启动和停止虚拟机。只有在窗口或菜单打开时，Dock 中才会显示图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
