            "value": "vm create --resume 被拒绝：工具链摘要与检查点记录不同。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "vm create --resume verifies the stages it skips and refuses when they no longer pass, when options or the toolchain changed, or while another run holds the checkpoint. A refusal is shown with the CLI's reason.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "vm create --resume verifies the stages it skips and refuses when they no longer pass, when options or the toolchain changed, or while another run holds the checkpoint. A refusal is shown with the CLI's reason."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "vm create --resume 会校验要跳过的阶段；阶段不再通过校验、选项或工具链变化、另一运行持有检查点时，续跑被拒绝。拒绝时显示 CLI 给出的原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "vm create is running for %@. Quitting sends SIGINT to its process group; the checkpoint then reads interrupted, and Resume continues from it later.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "vm create is running for %@. Quitting sends SIGINT to its process group; the checkpoint then reads interrupted, and Resume continues from it later."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%@ 的 vm create 正在运行。退出会向其进程组发送 SIGINT；检查点随后读作 interrupted，之后可用续跑从检查点继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "vm create sets 8 CPU cores, 8192 MB and NAT. Change them in Settings once the machine exists.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "vm create sets 8 CPU cores, 8192 MB and NAT. Change them in Settings once the machine exists."
